# FinTrack AI — client environment (.env)
# Copy to `.env`. The CLIENT only ever holds public Supabase values — never any
# AI/API keys. The anon key is safe to ship: Row-Level Security protects the data.
#
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com, run supabase/schema.sql in the
# SQL editor, then paste these from Project Settings → API:

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI keys do NOT ship in the app. All AI runs in Supabase Edge Functions with
# GEMINI_API_KEY / EMBED_SECRET stored as Supabase secrets (Dashboard → Edge
# Functions → Secrets, or `supabase secrets set ...`).
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Dev-only: eval harness (`npm run eval`) -----------------------------
# Used by evals/run.mjs on your machine. Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are ever
# bundled into the app, so these stay local.
EVAL_EMAIL=
EVAL_PASSWORD=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
